  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        115.84590148925781,
        27.289522171020508,
        337.6759338378906,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "8. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS ON TREATMENT OF FEVER CONDITIONS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        60.617027282714844,
        78.65290069580078,
        72.75702667236328
      ],
      "text": "Risks",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        73.62702941894531,
        399.1028137207031,
        87.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "There is now growing concern about increasing frequency of MDR strains of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        86.49703216552734,
        399.06317138671875,
        100.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "S. Typhi S. Paratyphi  and   with reduced susceptibility to first line antibiotics and old",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        99.62702941894531,
        399.0726318359375,
        113.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "fluoroquinolones. Resistance to nalidixic acid has been used to identify these strains.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        112.62702941894531,
        399.1229248046875,
        126.11702728271484
      ],
      "text": "There is, therefore, a risk of treatment failure, if the current first line antibiotics are",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        125.62702941894531,
        136.0529022216797,
        139.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "used for treatment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        138.6270294189453,
        399.1515197753906,
        152.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "The review identified only three instances of adverse events: severe leucopenia in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.6270294189453,
        399.06292724609375,
        165.11703491210938
      ],
      "text": "the chloramphenicol group; anaphylaxis in the ceftriaxone group, and a rash in the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.6269989013672,
        399.1028137207031,
        178.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "ciprofloxacin group. Side effects/toxicity of recommended antibiotics as outlined in",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.6269989013672,
        313.1728820800781,
        191.11700439453125
      ],
      "text": "section 6.2, WHO Model Formulary for Children [WHO 2010].",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        202.1455841064453,
        208.3529815673828,
        214.13558959960938
      ],
      "text": "8.6.3\t Acceptability and feasibility:",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        217.8002166748047,
        399.1029052734375,
        231.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "Value was placed on the benefits of recommended antibiotics in hastening recovery,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        230.8002166748047,
        399.0829162597656,
        244.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "improving symptoms, and preventing complications of poorly treated disease.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        243.8002166748047,
        399.1329040527344,
        257.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "Although the current first line antibiotics may be cheap, the cost of a shorter course of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        256.8002014160156,
        399.04296875,
        270.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "ciprofloxacin may be comparable to a 14-day chloramphenicol regimen [Phongmany",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        269.8002014160156,
        399.1027526855469,
        283.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "2005]. In addition, the increasing numbers of clinical failures with the current first",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        282.8002014160156,
        399.072998046875,
        296.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "line treatment suggest there is a cost advantage of using more efficacious medicines",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        295.8002014160156,
        187.22288513183594,
        309.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "in the rising levels of resistance.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        308.8002014160156,
        396.8504943847656,
        322.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "Although fluoroquinolones are effective and safe, there are still unfounded con­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        321.8002014160156,
        396.8527526855469,
        335.29022216796875
      ],
      "text": "cerns of ciprofloxacin safety in children that may still affect its uptake by physicians.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.35609436035156,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.69009399414062,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "65",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}